      "title": "-",
      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {}
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# OmniVoice Local Deployment\n\n## Model policy\n\nPixelle uses ModelScope first for ComfyUI model assets. Use fallback sources only when the required file is missing from ModelScope or the ModelScope file API is unavailable.\n\n## Local paths\n\n- OmniVoice models: `E:\\ComfyUIData\\models\\omnivoice`\n- Whisper models: `E:\\ComfyUIData\\models\\audio_encoders`\n- Custom nodes: `E:\\ComfyUIData\\custom_nodes`\n\n## Current default models\n\nThe default workflow values use:\n\n- `OmniVoice-bf16`\n- `whisper-large-v3`\n\nThese are the default-required models for this workflow. Optional full precision `OmniVoice` and `whisper-large-v3-turbo` can be added later only when the workflow defaults or runtime selection require them.\n\n## Reference audio\n\nLoadAudio nodes default to `None` for portability. Upload or select your own reference audio before running voice clone, longform, or multi-speaker branches.\n\n## Voice design attributes\n\nUse comma-separated English attributes, for example:\n\n`female, young, medium pitch, british accent`\n\n## Multi-speaker format\n\n[Speaker_1]: Hello, this is speaker one.\n[Speaker_2]: Hello, this is speaker two.\n[Speaker_1]: The OmniVoice local workflow is ready.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#c09430",
      "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)"
    },
